OL,3,GNEWSACastle reopens for first time in
OL,4,Aeight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanterbury Castle has temporarily
OL,7,Freopened to the public for the first
OL,8,Ftime since closing eight years ago due
OL,9,Fto safety concerns.
OL,11,FThe site is open until the end of
OL,12,FFebruary so people can see work that
OL,13,Fhas taken place as part of a
OL,14,Frestoration project which will be fully
OL,15,Fcompleted in 2027.
OL,17,FA section of the gardens near the
OL,18,FCastle Street entrance are also open,
OL,19,Fwith more of the grounds to open in the
OL,20,Fnext few weeks, Canterbury City Council
OL,21,Fsays.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
