OL,3,GNEWSACastle reopens for first time in
OL,4,Aeight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs bats have been found, no further
OL,7,Fwork can take place at the Norman keep
OL,8,Funtil early spring when the animals
OL,9,Fhibernate, at which point the castle
OL,10,Fwill close again for four months for
OL,11,Fthe final part of the project.
